## Red work

The existing leased test covers scoped enqueue identity, conflicting payloads,
bounded retry timing, exhaustion and dead-letter output, replay authorization and
audit, and active-lease replay rejection. It uses the isolated PostgreSQL 16
harness with two independent connections.

The test was not redesigned. The supplied checkpoint showed that the test was
already run before this reassigned role resumed. The test bytes did not change,
so this role did not rerun it.

